DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
25010::$$$message_0183_0000_0000$$$::"Let's eat!"[lr]::
25011::$$$message_0183_0000_0001$$$::Everyone claps their hands, not quite in unison.[lr]::
25012::$$$message_0183_0000_0002$$$::The table is set with a grilled fish breakfast for six.::
25013::$$$message_0183_0001_0000$$$::"All right, Sakura got up early to make us all breakfast. Make sure you savor the food and thank her."[lr]::
25014::$$$message_0183_0001_0001$$$::Two people nod at me seriously.[lr]::
25015::$$$message_0183_0001_0002$$$::Uh, I'm not talking to you, but to Team Fujimura trying to trade their boiled spinach for the simmered chicken.::
25016::$$$message_0183_0002_0000$$$::"Oh, there's natto again.[lr]::
25017::$$$message_0183_0002_0001$$$::I said I don't like it, but you never learn, Sakura.[lr]::
25018::$$$message_0183_0002_0002$$$::Taiga, you can eat natto, right? I'll trade it for your rolled omelet."::
25019::$$$message_0183_0003_0000$$$::"I don't mind, but you still can't eat natto? You shouldn't be a picky eater. Having said that, I'm only willing to give up half of my omelet.[lr]::
25020::$$$message_0183_0003_0001$$$::Mufufu, you're still a little hatchling if you can't comprehend how good natto and rice are."::
25021::$$$message_0183_0004_0000$$$::"Only half... [cacheimage storage=イリヤ07d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ07d(中)]Fine, I'll settle for that exchange rate.[lr]::
25022::$$$message_0183_0004_0001$$$::I can't finish it all anyway. You'll get caught in Sakura's schemes before you know it."::
25023::$$$message_0183_0005_0000$$$::"Yup, equivalent exchange. I got all of Illya's natto for half of my eggs![lr]::
25024::$$$message_0183_0005_0001$$$::...Also, what do you mean, Sakura's schemes?"::
25025::$$$message_0183_0006_0000$$$::"It's okay, no need to worry.[lr]::
25026::$$$message_0183_0006_0001$$$::I made sure to count the calories, so you won't gain any weight if you eat it all and get enough exercise![lr]::
25027::$$$message_0183_0006_0002$$$::Right, Saber?"::
25028::$$$message_0183_0007_0000$$$::"Sakura is correct.[lr]::
25029::$$$message_0183_0007_0001$$$::I can't say for sure since you have a different physique, but I'm sure you won't be the only one to gain weight, Taiga."::
25030::$$$message_0183_0008_0000$$$::"See? So go ahead and eat up! I have plenty left over for seconds."[lr]::
25031::$$$message_0183_0008_0001$$$::"Of course... Sakura, I would like an extra large helping."::
25032::$$$message_0183_0009_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
25033::$$$message_0183_0009_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
25034::$$$message_0183_0009_0002$$$::I meet Rider's eyes.[lr]::
25035::$$$message_0183_0009_0003$$$::It looks like we're thinking the same thing, but silence is golden.::
25036::$$$message_0183_0010_0000$$$::"What about you, Rider? Your rice bowl is already empty."[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][smudgeoff textoff=0 time=200][lr]::
25037::$$$message_0183_0010_0001$$$::"One bowl is enough for me. I don't have Saber's digestive system, nor am I as fuel-inefficient.[lr]::
25038::$$$message_0183_0010_0002$$$::I'm going to have some tea, so please enjoy the rest of your meal."::
25039::$$$message_0183_0011_0000$$$::Rider pours herself a cup of tea.[lr]::
25040::$$$message_0183_0011_0001$$$::The way she silently brings the cup to her lips is so elegant.::
25041::$$$message_0183_0012_0000$$$::"...I heard that, Rider. One bowl is enough for me if I'm only operating on minimum provisions.[lr]::
25042::$$$message_0183_0012_0001$$$::But seeing as we have so much food, we shouldn't leave any left over. Rations shouldn't go to waste, and moreover..."[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
25043::$$$message_0183_0013_0000$$$::"Om nom, this boiled turnip's really good.[lr]::
25044::$$$message_0183_0013_0001$$$::Ah, I'll have yours if you aren't eating it, Saber."[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
25045::$$$message_0183_0014_0000$$$::"I must refuse."[lr]::
25046::$$$message_0183_0014_0001$$$::"Gyah!?"::
25047::$$$message_0183_0015_0000$$$::"Moreover, Sakura went to the trouble of cooking this. I must take my time to enjoy it. [wvl][se volume=70 storage=se045.wav]Delicious food should be savored to the heart's content."::
25048::$$$message_0183_0016_0000$$$::Saber just voiced a wonderfully wise opinion.[lr]::
25049::$$$message_0183_0016_0001$$$::Or so I'd say, if she didn't just ask for a third serving.[lr]::
25050::$$$message_0183_0016_0002$$$::...Everything should be consumed in moderation.[smudgeoff textoff=0 time=100]::
25051::$$$message_0183_0017_0000$$$::"Huh? The miso soup today tastes different. You didn't help her make it, did you, Shirou? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06d(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ06d(中)]It's kinda messy. [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01e(遠)][wvl][fg textoff=0 index=1000 time=300 pos=r storage=ライダー私服01e(遠)]The flavor is strong, but the potatoes are cut all thin and pretty. It's clumsy yet delicate. Like a sculpture carved by a novice."::
25052::$$$message_0183_0018_0000$$$::"Ah... Well, she's still learning. I don't think there's anything wrong with it, though."[lr]::
25053::$$$message_0183_0018_0001$$$::"Hmm, I liked how it was before, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ05a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ05a(中)]but I guess she has potential.[lr]::
25054::$$$message_0183_0018_0002$$$::This is more or less how Sella's Japanese cooking is."::
25055::$$$message_0183_0019_0000$$$::Rider places a hand on her chest in relief.[lr]::
25056::$$$message_0183_0019_0001$$$::...Hopefully she isn't lying.[lr]::
25057::$$$message_0183_0019_0002$$$::To tell you the truth, today's miso soup is Rider's careful work.::
25058::$$$message_0183_0020_0000$$$::This morning, I overslept and found Sakura and Rider both in the kitchen.[lr]::
25059::$$$message_0183_0020_0001$$$::Saber and I set the table, while keeping a watchful eye on Rider struggling with the soup pot.::
25060::$$$message_0183_0021_0000$$$::"Ah, Ms. Fujimura, it's almost time. The cultural festival planning committee meeting will start soon."[lr]::
25061::$$$message_0183_0021_0001$$$::"Oh, dang. Ryudou will get mad at me if I show up late today.[lr]::
25062::$$$message_0183_0021_0002$$$::Ugh, that's the life of a teacher. I don't even have time to enjoy tea after breakfast."[lr]::
25063::$$$message_0183_0021_0003$$$::Fuji-nee gets up with her helmet in one hand, ready to ride her moped, the Tiger.::
25064::$$$message_0183_0022_0000$$$::"See you there, Sakura. [cacheimage storage=藤09a腕b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤09a腕b(中)]Make sure you aren't late either, Shirou. Just because you aren't going to college [cacheimage storage=桜制服03e(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜制服03e(中)]doesn't mean you can afford to slack off!"[wvs][clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から time=400 storage=藤09a腕b(中)]::
25065::$$$message_0183_0023_0000$$$::Our English teacher[line len=2]age twenty-____, single[line len=2]leaves with a smile and a wave.[lr]::
25066::$$$message_0183_0023_0001$$$::Fuji-nee's been visiting earlier than usual, since the cultural festival is coming up.[lr]::
25067::$$$message_0183_0023_0002$$$::That goes for Sakura too, since she's the new kyudo club captain, but morning practice during the pre-festival period is just a quick meeting.[lr]::
25068::$$$message_0183_0023_0003$$$::So, she actually has about thirty more minutes of time than usual.::
25069::$$$message_0183_0024_0000$$$::"The festival is almost here. I hope my sister can come back by then."[lr]::
25070::$$$message_0183_0024_0001$$$::"Yeah. She said she'd come back for summer break, but it's already October. I wonder what happened."[lr]::
25071::$$$message_0183_0024_0002$$$::...Nothing big, I hope.::
25072::$$$message_0183_0025_0000$$$::"Hmph. Rin brought that on herself.[lr]::
25073::$$$message_0183_0025_0001$$$::It's not something you can settle in a month. She tried to copy the Jeweled Sword and failed, you know.[lr]::
25074::$$$message_0183_0025_0002$$$::...It's way too early for her, so I knew nothing would happen, but if she somehow had caused the Second Magic to explode, who knows what would have happened."::
25075::$$$message_0183_0026_0000$$$::Illya looks exasperated.[lr]::
25076::$$$message_0183_0026_0001$$$::...It did happen in her castle, though. I guess anyone would hold a grudge over something like that.::
25077::$$$message_0183_0027_0000$$$::   Let's rewind two months ago.[lr]::
25078::$$$message_0183_0027_0001$$$::One day, before summer break, Tohsaka was in her usual mood.[lr]::
25079::$$$message_0183_0027_0002$$$::"I need a secret weapon if I'm going to the Clock Tower in London. There's gonna be a lot of weirdos over there[cacheimage storage=凛私服04c(中)],[wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服04c(中)] and I need something to express my dignity, as a backwater mage from East Asia."::
25080::$$$message_0183_0028_0000$$$::That's what she said before casually[line len=2][fadein textoff=0 noclear=1 vague=200 time=600 rule=走る感じ(右から) storage=oアインツ洋館-(曇)]okay, knowing Tohsaka, she probably did take precautions[line len=2][wait canskip=0 time=300][wt canskip=0][fadein textoff=0 noclear=1 time=600 vague=200 rule=走る感じ(右から) storage=white]whipped up an extra-small miniature of the Jeweled Sword to wear as a pendant to let her observe energy waves from parallel worlds.[wm canskip=0][lr]::
25081::$$$message_0183_0028_0001$$$::That turned out to be a spectacular failure on a scale we ordinary folks couldn't even imagine.::
25082::$$$message_0183_0029_0000$$$::As a result, she lost all the data, material, and even the money she borrowed from Sakura to prepare.::
25083::$$$message_0183_0030_0000$$$::According to Illya, she's a freak for even surviving the accident. That freak became a walking corpse after checking her bank account balance.[lr]::
25084::$$$message_0183_0030_0001$$$::"Emiya... Introduce me to a part-time job..."[lr]::
25085::$$$message_0183_0030_0002$$$::That would have been bad enough, but one day, something absurd happened.::
25086::$$$message_0183_0031_0000$$$::Later, they would call it the Winchester Affair, a tale of the price one pays when reaching for True Magic.::
25087::$$$message_0183_0032_0000$$$::And so...[lr]::
25088::$$$message_0183_0032_0001$$$::"...I'm really in trouble this time. They might even slap me with a Seal Designation. I need to take care of this before it gets out of hand."[lr]::
25089::$$$message_0183_0032_0002$$$::...Tohsaka went off on a trip to the Clock Tower, the headquarters of the world of magecraft in London.::
25090::$$$message_0183_0033_0000$$$::"So what happened after all that, anyway?[lr]::
25091::$$$message_0183_0033_0001$$$::I thought she just messed up your castle."::
25092::$$$message_0183_0034_0000$$$::"Wow, you have no idea. Rin unleashed a singularity that wasn't even weaponized. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ03a(中)][wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=3][chgfg textoff=0 pos=c time=300 storage=イリヤ03a(中)]This entire town nearly became a terminal for it![lr]::
25093::$$$message_0183_0034_0001$$$::It could've warped the laws of causality, mixed up phenomena, and connected to the future and the past...[cacheimage storage=イリヤ07a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 pos=c time=300 storage=イリヤ07a(中)] Do you get what I'm saying?"::
25094::$$$message_0183_0035_0000$$$::"Uh... You mean it could've created a world where anything's possible?"[lr]::
25095::$$$message_0183_0035_0001$$$::"To put it simply, yeah.[lr]::
25096::$$$message_0183_0035_0002$$$::In more exact terms, it almost became a world that attracted every possibility that could occur in this town."::
25097::$$$message_0183_0036_0000$$$::Hmmm.[lr]::
25098::$$$message_0183_0036_0001$$$::Every possibility would have been drawn out, huh?[lr]::
25099::$$$message_0183_0036_0002$$$::Like winning the lottery, getting invaded by aliens, achieving immortality, or everyone in Fuyuki coming to kill me. Stuff like that.[lr]::
25100::$$$message_0183_0036_0003$$$::Every dark joke that we can't completely rule out ever happening would come true.::
25101::$$$message_0183_0037_0000$$$::"...I see. That bad, huh? ...That's not exactly how it looked to me, though..."[lr]::
25102::$$$message_0183_0037_0001$$$::It was more like a fairy-tale world.[lr]::
25103::$$$message_0183_0037_0002$$$::Something like Dodgson's Wonderland.[lr]::
25104::$$$message_0183_0037_0003$$$::A maze-like escape game with our lives on the line.::
25105::$$$message_0183_0038_0000$$$::"...That came as a surprise to us, too. What Rin tried to do is beyond human capability. It might have become a bigger crisis than the Holy Grail War."[lr]::
25106::$$$message_0183_0038_0001$$$::One of the victims muses.[lr]::
25107::$$$message_0183_0038_0002$$$::Rider wasn't the only victim; it included everyone here, plus one.::
25108::$$$message_0183_0039_0000$$$::"Huh? What's wrong, Sakura?"[lr]::
25109::$$$message_0183_0039_0001$$$::"Ah... No, nothing important. I was thinking about what Rider just said..."::
25110::$$$message_0183_0040_0000$$$::Sakura hesitates. If she doesn't want to continue, I'll just nod.[lr]::
25111::$$$message_0183_0040_0001$$$::But...[lr]::
25112::$$$message_0183_0040_0002$$$::"She reacted to the words 'Holy Grail War.'[lr]::
25113::$$$message_0183_0040_0003$$$::And here I thought you hadn't realized at all, but you just weren't sure if you believed it."[lr]::
25114::$$$message_0183_0040_0004$$$::...the winter girl didn't fail to catch that.::
25115::$$$message_0183_0041_0000$$$::"...What about the Holy Grail War, Illya? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ01a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ01a(中)]That's been over for half a year."[lr]::
25116::$$$message_0183_0041_0001$$$::"Is it, though? The Servants might not think so.[lr]::
25117::$$$message_0183_0041_0002$$$::Well, Saber, Rider? I think you both feel it, too."[lr]::
25118::$$$message_0183_0041_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
25119::$$$message_0183_0041_0004$$$::"..."::
25120::$$$message_0183_0042_0000$$$::"Rider? Do you and Saber know what she's talking about?"[lr]::
25121::$$$message_0183_0042_0001$$$::"N-no, I don't.[lr]::
25122::$$$message_0183_0042_0002$$$::...But as Illya says, the atmosphere in this town feels tense.[lr]::
25123::$$$message_0183_0042_0003$$$::...It's just a subtle feeling of wrongness, so I've been keeping an eye on things."::
25124::$$$message_0183_0043_0000$$$::A subtle feeling of wrongness...?[lr]::
25125::$$$message_0183_0043_0001$$$::Are you kidding me?[lr]::
25126::$$$message_0183_0043_0002$$$::Why would Rider wait all this time to bring up something so obviously bad?::
25127::$$$message_0183_0044_0000$$$::"...What about you, Saber? Do you know what Rider's talking about?"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
25128::$$$message_0183_0044_0001$$$::"...Yes. This is only conjecture, but may I, Shirou?"[lr]::
25129::$$$message_0183_0044_0002$$$::I nod silently.::
25130::$$$message_0183_0045_0000$$$::"Very well.[lr]::
25131::$$$message_0183_0045_0001$$$::To be frank, the hostility isn't coming from the town, but from us Servants... Am I correct, Rider? We've started to feel a mild hostility toward each other for the last few days.[lr]::
25132::$$$message_0183_0045_0002$$$::It isn't rational, but instinctual, telling us we need to defeat our enemy. In other words..."::
25133::$$$message_0183_0046_0000$$$::"The emotional excitement of being a Servant in the Holy Grail War.[lr]::
25134::$$$message_0183_0046_0001$$$::...I hate to admit it, but I've come to the same conclusion."::
25135::$$$message_0183_0047_0000$$$::Saber and Rider glare at each other.[lr]::
25136::$$$message_0183_0047_0001$$$::What they're saying is very simple.[lr]::
25137::$$$message_0183_0047_0002$$$::"Oh. So you're saying that the Holy Grail War is happening again."[lr]::
25138::$$$message_0183_0047_0003$$$::The reasons and methods don't matter now.[lr]::
25139::$$$message_0183_0047_0004$$$::That's the only possible conclusion.::
25140::$$$message_0183_0048_0000$$$::"Th-that can't be true! It doesn't make sense, Senpai! The Holy Grail is gone![lr]::
25141::$$$message_0183_0048_0001$$$::Besides, [wvl canskip=0 time=300]um, [wvl canskip=0 time=300]well, [cacheimage storage=桜制服08k(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=桜制服08k(近)]if the Holy Grail War is happening, wouldn't the Church tell us!?"::
25142::$$$message_0183_0049_0000$$$::"Yeah. But they didn't.[lr]::
25143::$$$message_0183_0049_0001$$$::So it isn't a new Holy Grail War, but the old one restarting... That adds up, doesn't it?"::
25144::$$$message_0183_0050_0000$$$::The Masters are still alive, the Servants are still here, and we still have our Command Spells.[lr]::
25145::$$$message_0183_0050_0001$$$::My left hand still has one Command Spell I neglected to use.::
25146::$$$message_0183_0051_0000$$$::"Huh. Well, it's certainly plausible.[lr]::
25147::$$$message_0183_0051_0001$$$::Shirou won the fifth war, but he didn't use the Holy Grail. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11f(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ11f(中)]The Servants still remain, so it could mean that something set the war back in motion."::
25148::$$$message_0183_0052_0000$$$::"A chance for the losers to make a comeback?[lr]::
25149::$$$message_0183_0052_0001$$$::But Illya, who decided that Shirou won the war? I thought it ended without a victor."::
25150::$$$message_0183_0053_0000$$$::...Rider isn't saying that because she doesn't accept my victory. She's dissatisfied that the war had no victor and approves of me not being the clear victor.::
25151::$$$message_0183_0054_0000$$$::"Who else but the Holy Grail?[lr]::
25152::$$$message_0183_0054_0001$$$::Whatever the outcome, the Holy Grail sees Shirou as the victor. I'm the one saying it, so it can't be wrong, get it?"[lr]::
25153::$$$message_0183_0054_0002$$$::"...[chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ライダー私服02d(中)][say storage=snplg09_rad_0080 name=ライダー]I understand.[lr]::
25154::$$$message_0183_0054_0003$$$::Then I ask you, as the Holy Grail: how can we break out of this situation?"[lr]::
25155::$$$message_0183_0054_0004$$$::"Huh?"::
25156::$$$message_0183_0055_0000$$$::Rider is looking at Illya earnestly.[lr]::
25157::$$$message_0183_0055_0001$$$::She must see the resumed Holy Grail War as a threat because it would put Sakura in danger.::
25158::$$$message_0183_0056_0000$$$::"Hold on, Rider. We don't have to do anything, do we?[lr]::
25159::$$$message_0183_0056_0001$$$::You say it's restarted, but the Holy Grail doesn't exist anymore. We don't have a reason to fight."[lr]::
25160::$$$message_0183_0056_0002$$$::"Well said. Yes, Shirou's right.[lr]::
25161::$$$message_0183_0056_0003$$$::It's true that something is strange about Fuyuki lately, but it isn't worth paying attention to."::
25162::$$$message_0183_0057_0000$$$::"What's stranger is that Servants are still here after the Holy Grail War is over. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ11a(中)]Feeling a little tense is hardly something to get hung up on, compared to that."[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01a(中)][wvs][fg opacity=0 textoff=0 left=-154 index=3000 top=71 time=100 storage=セイバー私服01a(中)]::
25163::$$$message_0183_0058_0000$$$::"Yeah. Even if someone were scheming something against Rider and the others, it wouldn't change anything. You can fight them, after all."::
25164::$$$message_0183_0059_0000$$$::"Have you heard of the rule of the strong?[lr]::
25165::$$$message_0183_0059_0001$$$::People who stand out make enemies easily, but only the people who can protect everyone from those enemies are the ones that are truly strong.[lr]::
25166::$$$message_0183_0059_0002$$$::Someone who's good at fighting is just a thug.[lr]::
25167::$$$message_0183_0059_0003$$$::And as far as I know, we have two people here who are truly strong."[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
25168::$$$message_0183_0060_0000$$$::"Yeah, Shirou's right again. You're so smart today, Shirou! Full marks!"[lr]::
25169::$$$message_0183_0060_0001$$$::...Mrgh, I'm glad you approve.[lr]::
25170::$$$message_0183_0060_0002$$$::Because I know you're just going to laze around all day anyway.::
25171::$$$message_0183_0061_0000$$$::"[font italic=true]Like I said,[font italic=false] [wm canskip=0][wvl canskip=0 time=300]if there's a problem, it's with you two, Saber and Rider.[lr]::
25172::$$$message_0183_0061_0001$$$::Do you [font italic=true]want[font italic=false] to start fighting again?"::
25173::$$$message_0183_0062_0000$$$::Absolutely not... [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服17a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服17a(近)]Though if Rider challenges me, I'd accept."::
25174::$$$message_0183_0063_0000$$$::"I could say the same. I've lost to you several times. [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服04h(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ライダー私服04h(近)]I wouldn't mind repaying the favor, if I ever get a chance."::
25175::$$$message_0183_0064_0000$$$::"Wow..."[lr]::
25176::$$$message_0183_0064_0001$$$::I can practically see the sparks flying.[lr]::
25177::$$$message_0183_0064_0002$$$::When you peel away the peaceful veneer, they really are rivals.::
25178::$$$message_0183_0065_0000$$$::"Good. You aren't cats in heat, so I expect you both to behave yourselves. I know you aren't the type to go hunting humans just to kill time."[lr]::
25179::$$$message_0183_0065_0001$$$::"Illyasviel, I resent that example. I am no fiend. Though I can't say the same for her, given her history."::
25180::$$$message_0183_0066_0000$$$::"Mrgh..."[lr]::
25181::$$$message_0183_0066_0001$$$::Rider looks frustrated, but she doesn't protest.[lr]::
25182::$$$message_0183_0066_0002$$$::I don't think Saber's any less bestial than she is in certain respects, but setting that aside...::
25183::$$$message_0183_0067_0000$$$::"Um...so what's going on?"[lr]::
25184::$$$message_0183_0067_0001$$$::"I don't think the others will attack, so let's just wait and see for now.[lr]::
25185::$$$message_0183_0067_0002$$$::Nothing's happened yet, so I don't think we have to go out of our way to investigate anything."::
25186::$$$message_0183_0068_0000$$$::"R-right. Oh, why don't we try asking the other Servants? Maybe they've sensed something, too.[lr]::
25187::$$$message_0183_0068_0001$$$::I see Lancer in town often."::
25188::$$$message_0183_0069_0000$$$::Sakura makes an odd suggestion.[lr]::
25189::$$$message_0183_0069_0001$$$::But I'm completely fine with it. I bet Lancer would be willing to share his take on all this.::
25190::$$$message_0183_0070_0000$$$::"We'll take the opportunity to look into this, too.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
25191::$$$message_0183_0070_0001$$$::Also, Sakura, isn't it time for school?"[lr]::
25192::$$$message_0183_0070_0002$$$::"Oh, you're right! Sorry, I'll clean up right away!"[lr]::
25193::$$$message_0183_0070_0003$$$::"No, cleaning up is my job. Please relax and go to school."[lr]::
25194::$$$message_0183_0070_0004$$$::"Oh, okay. Thanks, Rider. I'll leave it to you."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から storage=桜制服03d(中) time=400]::
25195::$$$message_0183_0071_0000$$$::Sakura cheerfully gets ready to leave.[lr]::
25196::$$$message_0183_0071_0001$$$::I still have about twenty minutes left, so I'll help Rider.::
25197::$$$message_0183_0072_0000$$$::"I'm leaving! Don't skip class, Senpai!"[lr]::
25198::$$$message_0183_0072_0001$$$::Sakura hurries off to school.[lr]::
25199::$$$message_0183_0072_0002$$$::Morning is over, for now.[wm canskip=0]::
25200::$$$message_0183_0073_0000$$$::"Both of you, give me the dishes to rinse. I'll take care of them all once I get changed."[lr]::
25201::$$$message_0183_0073_0001$$$::"...Thank you. To be honest, I'm not very good at washing dishes."[lr]::
25202::$$$message_0183_0073_0002$$$::Rider isn't clumsy, but she sometimes can't control her own strength. She's a bowl-breaker in a different way than Saber is.::
25203::$$$message_0183_0074_0000$$$::Anyway, I go back to my room.[lr]::
25204::$$$message_0183_0074_0001$$$::And then...[lr]::
25205::$$$message_0183_0074_0002$$$::"Shirou. About earlier, please let me know if you decide to go out on patrol at night.[lr]::
25206::$$$message_0183_0074_0003$$$::I know what Illyasviel said, but something is bothering me."::
25207::$$$message_0183_0075_0000$$$::I appreciate the thought.[lr]::
25208::$$$message_0183_0075_0001$$$::I'm glad she understands. I feel a little guilty about it, but a part of me is excited to go back to half a year ago.::
25209::$$$message_0183_0076_0000$$$::"...All right. Once I get a chance, I'll let you know when we can go out at night. Something's definitely off with the town, so I want to patrol just in case. [lr]::
25210::$$$message_0183_0076_0001$$$::...Though I can't even imagine going on patrol without you, Saber."::
25211::$$$message_0183_0077_0000$$$::"Yes. I believed you would say that, Shirou."[lr]::
25212::$$$message_0183_0077_0001$$$::Same here.[lr]::
25213::$$$message_0183_0077_0002$$$::If Saber accompanies me on patrol, I shouldn't die too easily.::
25214::$$$message_0183_0078_0000$$$::The time is past 7:30 AM.[lr]::
25215::$$$message_0183_0078_0001$$$::Now, should I go to school or relax at home?[lr]::
25216::$$$message_0183_0078_0002$$$::Things have gotten strange, but rushing won't help me learn anything.::
25217::$$$message_0183_0079_0000$$$::"Eh, I'll look into it when I feel like it."[lr]::
25218::$$$message_0183_0079_0001$$$::Fortunately, I have three days off starting tomorrow.[lr]::
25219::$$$message_0183_0079_0002$$$::They're meant to be relaxing, not distressing.[lr]::
25220::$$$message_0183_0079_0003$$$::I just need to live my life without being too tense.::
925081::$$$message_9183_0028_0001$$$::That turned out to be a spectacular failure on a scale we ordinary folks couldn't even imagine.[r]::�